  "body": "The percentage is a risk score from the model, not an exact chance that you will default. The honest numbers are the observed band default rates from validation data: applicants in the low band defaulted at 2.84%, medium at 7.56%, high at 18.28%, and very high at 30.88%. This risk score ranks relative risk, not a promise about any individual."
